# An allowlist: only what `bun install`, the client build and `wrangler dev` need goes into the build context.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!bunfig.toml
!tsconfig*.json
!wrangler.jsonc
!worker-configuration.d.ts
!src/
!public/
!migrations/
!infra/entrypoint.sh
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
**/.env*
**/.dev.vars*
**/dist
**/coverage
public/assets
**/.DS_Store
